  unitName: Sightless Light Phaedra
  unitId: 851018
  unitNumber: 8659
  description: "Born into nouveau riche, Phaedra's house was never truly considered
    by the nobles as one of their kind. Though the sight of their ilk elicited casual
    disdain from their snobbish elite peers, her parents strove to provide her with
    the best education money can buy; after all, Phaedra was their only hope in rising
    up the social ladder.While they busied themselves hobnobbing with the upper crust
    of society, the first embers of revolution were being stoked. The Wolf's Eyes\u2014armed
    visionaries led by a power-hungry man named Baelfyr\u2014whipped the masses into
    a frenzied bloodlust. Talk of retribution against the Vale over the Starsage's
    corruption spurred conscription, including Phaedra's bodyguard, a rugged and
    loyal man named Angahl.Fearing that the kingdom was no longer safe, Phaedra's
    parents sent her in the guise of a new recruit to seek Angahl out at the forward
    camp. Once there was a lull in the fighting, he would secret her away to the
    countryside. But when the injured arrived in droves, Phaedra was immediately
    called upon as a medic, and she never saw her guardian.Deep in the midst of conflict,
    Phaedra was rescuing the stranded in the Vale when she was struck by a burst
    of Fae magic. Blinded and reeling from pain, Phaedra still pressed on, offering
    as much aid as she could until exertion overwhelmed her. When she next awoke,
    the world was awash in a veil of white\u2014including her memories.It seemed
    that something important was taken from her, but what? A few friendly spirit-like
    entities accompanied her quiet recuperation in this gentle clearing, but all
    she had to go on was a carved flower emblem..."
  summonDesc: Another human, here?<br>I wonder how long it's been...
  fusionDesc: I'm not sure what's different from before, but I feel a little better.<br>Thank
    you.
  evoDesc: I...remember things...<br>It's strange, but they don't frighten me as
    much as I thought they might.
  element: 5
  rarity: 7
